WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Boy, please change seats.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,160
The kids here are making trouble

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,960
Brother Mei Yan is destined to be killed

4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,980
This child is not related to him by blood and was stolen.

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,540
What are you staring at my child?

6
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:16,900
Are you trying to abduct my child?

7
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:19,350
Why are you, a grown man, staring at other people's children?

8
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:25,640
Take a look at what's on the child's wrist.

9
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,760
hold him hold him

10
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,480
He has a murder weapon on him and he's coming for you.

11
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:34,980
You are going to suffer a bloody disaster today. Stop, kid, and give it to me.

12
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:50,010
No one can try to steal my son. The killer is fine. Thank you. But this delay is enough.

13
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,730
Ning Xiushan should have closed its doors

14
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,740
Let's find an aluminum store to stay in first.

15
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,560
It seems to be the room in the corridor shot

16
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,520
Where is the boss? Where did he die?

17
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,480
Come and have a look quickly

18
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,000
What are you doing at night?

19
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,040
I can't open the door to this house

20
00:01:10,850 --> 00:01:13,290
No, there's an evil spirit coming through the door
